WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.915 --> 00:00:12.182
Southern Vietnamese Adaptive starts with a fresh learner profile. The dashboard has no invented progress. It asks for a baseline before adapting the practice.

2
00:00:13.386 --> 00:00:21.969
I start the baseline assessment. The first written exercise explains why it was selected and asks the learner to identify a tone.

3
00:00:23.175 --> 00:00:34.657
I select an answer. The application checks it and gives immediate feedback. Then I move to the next question, showing the actual practice flow rather than a slide about it.
